{"Title":"An Act relative to the retirement benefits of certain employees of the department of mental health ","BillNumber":"H2497","DocketNumber":"HD698","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"MCD1","Name":"Marjorie C. Decker","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/MCD1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-17T10:39:01.763"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"MCD1","Name":"Marjorie C. Decker","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/MCD1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-17T10:39:01.7633333"},{"Id":"WCG1","Name":"William C. Galvin","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/WCG1","ResponseDate":"2023-03-07T15:24:32.5"},{"Id":"L_S1","Name":"Lindsay N. Sabadosa","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/L_S1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-20T17:07:11.87"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H2497/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Decker of Cambridge, a petition (accompanied by bill, House, No. 2497) of Marjorie C. Decker, Lindsay N. Sabadosa and William C. Galvin relative to the retirement benefits of bargaining unit 8 employees within the Department of Mental Health.  Public Service.","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. Section 3 of chapter 32 of the General Laws, as appearing in the 2020 Official Edition, is hereby amended by inserting, in line 275, after the word \"prisoners;\" the following words:-- employees of the department of mental health within bargaining unit 8;\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Favorable","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J23","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J23"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}